    src   "This component will grab post-process result image and display here.\nNOTE!!! This only valid when target PostProcess RenderType is set to RenderTarget and bUseFullSize is set to false.\nUV channel:\n            UV0 ~ UV2: Check DreamText\n            UV3: TextureCoordinate for sampling PostProcess RenderTarget"
    text  "此组件将获取后处理结果图像并在此处显示。\n注意！！！ 这仅在目标后处理渲染类型设置为 RenderTarget 并且 bUseFullSize 设置为 false 时有效。\nUV 通道：\n            UV0 ~ UV2: 检查 DreamText\n            UV3: 用于采样后处理 RenderTarget 的纹理坐标"
    state machine
}
